ag *must perfectly match the left die-cut design* (same colors, graphics, text placement, and “Qwen Image” branding). \n- **Scene**: A bright kitchen with a white marble countertop. \n- **Cat & Props**: A cute white cat with large eyes holds a small white bowl of cat food. In front, a yellow plate holds cat food kibbles, a piece of salmon, and fresh green leaves. \n- **Background**: Green cabinets, a window with natural light streaming in, and kitchen utensils (e.g., a wooden cutting board, pots) to create a cozy, homey atmosphere. \n\n\nEnsure the right-side package’s design elements (colors, logos, graphics, text) are *identical* to the left-side die-cut layout.", 1677934698, "randomize", "auto", "2k", "Third-party", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 4, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 2, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "sh